[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21242.788, "timestamp": "05:54:02", "text": "诸如此类的事情。而我，我只是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21245.43, "timestamp": "05:54:05", "text": "读着这些评论，就像我在画画一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21247.27, "timestamp": "05:54:07", "text": "因为我太……所以所有东西都放在一层里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21250.788, "timestamp": "05:54:10", "text": "懒惰，而且对图层的概念很困惑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21252.92, "timestamp": "05:54:12", "text": "滤镜等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21254.868, "timestamp": "05:54:14", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21257.03, "timestamp": "05:54:17", "text": "我当时想，“嗯，我可能应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21260.548, "timestamp": "05:54:20", "text": "开始学习一切事物是如何运作的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21263.59, "timestamp": "05:54:23", "text": "很安全。当我拿到我的画时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21267.19, "timestamp": "05:54:27", "text": "平板电脑，就像我尝试用它画画一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21270.07, "timestamp": "05:54:30", "text": "第一次，我过去常常在……做所有事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21272.868, "timestamp": "05:54:32", "text": "一层。然后我才意识到，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21276.23, "timestamp": "05:54:36", "text": "你应该做第二层。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21280.868, "timestamp": "05:54:40", "text": "不，只是，哦，我们可以做到。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21282.948, "timestamp": "05:54:42", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21285.27, "timestamp": "05:54:45", "text": "那时我才意识到，原来其他人也是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21288.708, "timestamp": "05:54:48", "text": "人们会这样做。线稿之类的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21290.948, "timestamp": "05:54:50", "text": "先在一层画草图，然后再画一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21293.75, "timestamp": "05:54:53", "text": "线稿，你负责清理和其他所有工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21295.83, "timestamp": "05:54:55", "text": "然后你分层上色，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21298.868, "timestamp": "05:54:58", "text": "一切。我当时就想，哇。"}]